    {
      "subId": "1915303",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191530308"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191530308": {
            "id": "191530308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "The time passes as the two of you chat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530397"
            ]
          },
          "191530397": {
            "id": "191530397",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Did you infiltrate the House of Daena? And what about those rumors of special powers?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530398"
            ]
          },
          "191530398": {
            "id": "191530398",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What's with the Seelie pranking people?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530399"
            ]
          },
          "191530399": {
            "id": "191530399",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You're the Seelie, aren't you?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1915308",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191530801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191530801": {
            "id": "191530801",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "Okay, everyone's given us a lot of useful information. Let's go through it and try to organize everything.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530802"
            ]
          },
          "191530802": {
            "id": "191530802",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "Some things we heard were pretty straightforward, but others were just ridiculous...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530803"
            ]
          },
          "191530803": {
            "id": "191530803",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We should be able to figure out more about its identity and whereabouts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530804"
            ]
          },
          "191530804": {
            "id": "191530804",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "Yeah, let me think and see what I can make of it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530805"
            ]
          },
          "191530805": {
            "id": "191530805",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "(Okay, calm down Layla. I know the info's all over the place, but you can definitely do it.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530806"
            ]
          },
          "191530806": {
            "id": "191530806",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "(First, let's try to figure out the Seelie's identity based on the clues we currently have.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530807"
            ]
          },
          "191530807": {
            "id": "191530807",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "(Then, we'll analyze where it's been sighted and its motives... Finally, we'll piece everything together...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530808"
            ]
          },
          "191530808": {
            "id": "191530808",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "(From there, we should be able to predict its movement. Alright, let's give it a try.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1915309",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191530901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191530901": {
            "id": "191530901",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "Okay, I think I've got it now...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530902"
            ]
          },
          "191530902": {
            "id": "191530902",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, what've you come up with?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530903"
            ]
          },
          "191530903": {
            "id": "191530903",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "First, based on the information Katayoun provided, we can assume that the Seelie is a student from the Rtawahist Darshan.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530904"
            ]
          },
          "191530904": {
            "id": "191530904",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "The possibility of it being someone outside the Darshan can be ruled out because it'd be impossible to gain access to those two books without going through the librarian.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530905"
            ]
          },
          "191530905": {
            "id": "191530905",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "Next, leaving its crazy abilities aside, all the sightings took place in locations that are officially recommended for astrology observation by the Akademiya.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530906"
            ]
          },
          "191530906": {
            "id": "191530906",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "In other words, it's probably just conducting research, and the nature of its research is very similar to mine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530907"
            ]
          },
          "191530907": {
            "id": "191530907",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "The question that I submitted was no simple query, but it was able to give me a reply in just a day. This implies that it's familiar with a similar field of knowledge.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530908"
            ]
          },
          "191530908": {
            "id": "191530908",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "So, based on this reasoning, all we have to do is wait for it at the next astrological observation site.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530911"
            ]
          },
          "191530911": {
            "id": "191530911",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "Ah, uh... It's nothing, really. There are actually some other factors that I've been speculating about...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530912"
            ]
          },
          "191530912": {
            "id": "191530912",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "But that's not important right now, let's get going. Even though we have a lead, it's still hard to say whether we'll be able to make any discoveries.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191530913"
            ]
          },
          "191530913": {
            "id": "191530913",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "I'll tell you what I mean by that if the Seelie doesn't show up..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1915399",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "191539901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "191539901": {
            "id": "191539901",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "(Hmm... I think it's slowly starting to come together now...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191539909"
            ]
          },
          "191539909": {
            "id": "191539909",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "We should be able to see more from up above, but how do we get up there?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "191539910"
            ]
          },
          "191539910": {
            "id": "191539910",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "Let's try using the Elemental Monuments in the area."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}